Japanese:
『宿泊ならこちら！
　サービス満点、料理もうまい
　　　　ユークリッドＩＮＮへ』{END}

English:
“Lodging available!
For superior service and great
food, stay at the Euclid Inn!”{END}

Japanese:
『便利な雑貨屋
　旅のカバンにグミひとつ！
　各種グミのお求めはこちらで』{END}

女の人
「旅芸人って何を見せてくれるの
　かしらね？」{END}

English:
Woman
 I wonder what kind of tricks the
 performer has up his sleeve...{END}

Japanese:
おじさん
「この大きな屋敷は、オルソンさ
　んの家だよ」{END}

English:
Old Man
 This big house belongs to the
 Olsons.{END}

Japanese:
彼氏
「ああ、この時が永遠に続けばい
　いのに・・・」{END}

English:
Boyfriend
 Ahh, I wish this time would last
 forever...{END}

Juggler
 I'm the best juggler in the world!
 Twelve beanbags are nothing!{END}

Japanese:
子供
「どうしたら、あんなに上手にで
　きるんだろうね」{END}

子供
「ジャグラーって、すごい人なん
　だねぇ〜！」{END}

English:
Man
 I'm sorry!
 I won't do it again!{END}

Japanese:
女の子
「もう、お兄ちゃんたら、全然お
　店の手伝いしないのよ！！」{END}

兵士
「この先は、闘技場の観客席にな
　ります」{END}

English:
Soldier
 The coliseum's audience seating is
 this way.{END}

Japanese:
衛兵
「陛下の御前では、失礼のないよ
　うにお願いいたします」{END}

English:
Guard
 We request that you show His
 Majesty all due courtesy.{END}

Japanese:
剣士
「さてと、いっちょ腕試しといく
　か！！」{END}

English:
Swordsman
 I'm goin' to go out there and give
 it my best shot!!{END}

Japanese:
町の人
「こいつ、さっきから同じことば
　かり言って戦わないんだぜ」{END}

町の人
「イタタタタ・・・横っ腹が痛い
　よう・・・」{END}

English:
Citizen
 Owwww!
 My side! My side!{END}

Mage
 Tsk! Magic is forbidden?
 Straight-up idiotic nonsense!{END}

Maid
 A maid's work is harder than it
 looks!{END}

Maid
 Clean, clean, clean!
 La la la <heart>{END}

Child
 Ooh...
 I-I'm gonna pee my pants...{END}

Child
 Hahah.
 He's afraid of heights.{END}

Man
 Whoa, everyone below looks like
 ants from up here!{END}

Japanese:
兵士
「ダオスの軍隊は、まだここまで
　来ていないが、油断は禁物だ」{END}

English:
Knight
 Hmm...
 I see.{END}

Japanese:
兵士
「戦いの時に、気をつけるべき事
　を聞いていかないか？」{END}

兵士
「全体を見通す力、大局を見るこ
　とが重要なんだ」{END}

English:
Soldier
 It's very important to know what
 you're up against at all times.{END}

Soldier
 You must be pretty confident in
 yourself.{END}

Soldier
 Are you entering the tournament
 too?{END}

Japanese:
騎士
「今は魔物討伐の遠征でほとんど
　出払っているんだ」{END}

English:
Knight
 The monster extermination
 expedition is almost underway.{END}

Japanese:
騎士
「我々はユークリッド黒鎧騎士団
　だ」{END}

English:
Knight
 We're members of Euclid's
 Obsidian Knights.{END}

Chef
 What!?
 How can you reject this taste!?{END}

King
 Stay as long as you like to collect
 yourselves.{END}

Japanese:
ユークリッド王
「ダオス討伐の旅の無事を祈って
　いるぞ」{END}

English:
King of Euclid
 I pray for your safety on your
 journey to defeat Dhaos.{END}
